[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10023.67, "timestamp": "02:47:03", "text": "OBS 的 CPU 使用率是 58%。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10025.83, "timestamp": "02:47:05", "text": "达到60%"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10029.75, "timestamp": "02:47:09", "text": "我们在所有旧油中都发现了这一点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10032.87, "timestamp": "02:47:12", "text": "以前叠加层太多了，以至于它经常使用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10036.309, "timestamp": "02:47:16", "text": "它以前吃得太多，总是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10039.91, "timestamp": "02:47:19", "text": "以前是100%。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10045.19, "timestamp": "02:47:25", "text": "呃，首席运营官，但现在我很高兴我们是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10047.99, "timestamp": "02:47:27", "text": "减少并移除了一些东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10050.87, "timestamp": "02:47:30", "text": "但这同时也意味着像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10053.19, "timestamp": "02:47:33", "text": "我们可能是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10056.469, "timestamp": "02:47:36", "text": "呃，我们限制了自己，但我们仍然会"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10066.309, "timestamp": "02:47:46", "text": "所以我的意思是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10070.309, "timestamp": "02:47:50", "text": "对这东西进行优化是徒劳的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10071.83, "timestamp": "02:47:51", "text": "喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10075.349, "timestamp": "02:47:55", "text": "现在想想，"}]